libfwnt
------------------------------------------
libfwnt is a library for Windows NT data types.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libfwnt-devel-20260602-1bl1
  libfwnt1-20260602-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfwnt

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfwnt/archive/refs/tags/20260602.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfwnt-20260602-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfwnt-20260602-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfwnt-20260602-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwnt-20260602-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwnt1-20260602-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwnt-devel-20260602-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfwnt-20260602-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfwnt)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfwnt.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfwnt/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfwnt/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfwnt/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfwnt/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfwnt/README

(libfwnt1)
  /usr/bin/cygfwnt-1.dll

(libfwnt-devel)
  /usr/include/libfwnt.h
  /usr/include/libfwnt/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfwnt/error.h
  /usr/include/libfwnt/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfwnt/features.h
  /usr/include/libfwnt/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfwnt.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfwnt.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfwnt.3.gz

(python312-libfwnt)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfwnt.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfwnt.dll

